  "summary": "The saved mask (C9) comes from mhw_sea computed in C6. That step compares 2010-06-01..08-31 target SST against 31-day circularly smoothed thresholds for days of year 153\u2013244, which draw on raw thresholds for days 138\u2013259. Those raw thresholds come from C5's \u00b15-day pools built with date_from_doy (Jan 1 + doy\u22121). That mapping shifts the windows one day later in non-leap years, so baseline coverage is May 12\u2013Sep 20 in leap years and May 13\u2013Sep 21 in non-leap years; climatology does not affect the mask."
